Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:09:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] Duo: static Surface Duo wallpapers (default Indigo) read
 from the vendor partition

The stock wallpapers are in /vendor/app/surface_wallpapers. A first-run step sets Indigo as the default static
wallpaper and DUO-DE Settings > Wallpaper lets the user pick any of the nine. Static on purpose: with a live
wallpaper (Microsoft Launcher's Bing wallpaper) the other panel sometimes stays black after a screen flip.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
